*.mp4

# Launcher-managed UI texture for HoC outfit/backpack icons.
!\[MOD\] HoC Icons Outfit+backpack/gamedata/textures/
!\[MOD\] HoC Icons Outfit+backpack/gamedata/textures/ui/
!\[MOD\] HoC Icons Outfit+backpack/gamedata/textures/ui/ui_stalker2_armors.dds

# SYS Hud Hard is launcher-managed as a complete mod, including textures.
